   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Mushroom Festival in Hell**: back after 93 archived shows (833 days) [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **ween2003-12-09** (recommended): source not stated; 28 songs; 119 min [1]. Said about its sound: Spectrum analysis shows the recording is lossy; compression happened before the files were burned to CD [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Cover art uses a Paradiso Amsterdam photo by Garion96, remixed with show info by Chocolate Mike [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **ween2003-12-09**: source: DAT>CDR>WAV(EAC)>FLAC [1]. Also: Uploader ripped the CD to FLAC to avoid further loss, pending a true lossless copy surfacing [1]",
